h=A.mv("In the laundry service industry, clients often face issues of item loss and damage due to the common practice of mixing clothes in batches and returning them in a single container. These problems are further compounded by refund policies that limit complaints to 24 hours after retrieval, effectively minimizing the launderers' accountability. To solve this, I created LaundryTallyAI, a laundry tracking system powered by Artificial Intelligence, robust data management, and an interactive user interface. LaundryTallyAI helps users track and organize information about their clothes, launderers, and laundry instances, ensuring greater transparency and reducing the likelihood of loss or damage.","images/laundry-tally-ai/logo.png","Laundry Tally AI",A.c(["images/laundry-tally-ai/part-1.png","images/laundry-tally-ai/part-2.png","images/laundry-tally-ai/part-3.png"],i),h,"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1o-atjty0M1MVFX38wwMGSbbtWXaLAkD9/edit?usp=sharing&ouid=105393535889916860532&rtpof=true&sd=true")
